  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "AI與英文學習",
    "sub_ename": "AI AND ENGLISH LEARNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在讓學生學習運用不同類型生成式AI工具，並且在經由結合英語文專業領域知識，提升英文學習樂趣與動力。在課程中，學生除了會有機會接觸到不同的生成式AI工具外，也可以因應自己的興趣以及需要，設計出最適合的英文學習方式。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to take students to learn different kinds of Generative AI tools. Students will at the same time learn how to use these Generative AI tools to enhance their English learning interest and motivation. During the class, other than knowing and learning these Generative AI tools, students will also work with the course instructors to develop an AI English learning tool in order to find another way to improve their learning results.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
